# Internal files that live in the repo but must not be readable on the public
# site. Cloudflare Pages has no exclude list without a build step, and its
# _redirects rules are evaluated before static assets, so these send the
# reader to the home page. Keep this list in sync with docs/WEBSITE-CHECKLIST.md.
/docs/*        /    301
/scripts/*     /    301
/_data/*       /    301
/.claude/*     /    301
/.github/*     /    301
/.gitignore    /    301

